# Agent tooling working-copy state. These are injected by the local agent
# harness, not project source, and must never be committed: a stray `git add -A`
# would otherwise sweep plugin code, hook scripts, and local MCP credentials
# config into the repo.
.claude/
.openrig/
.mcp.json

